{"type":"text","timestamp":1787390846298,"sessionID":"ses_fd7355354ffe7kTYXjnT6SKuqc","part":{"id":"prt_028cbde4f001vAcR7PItTYctuS","messageID":"msg_028cbc8b7001QzTQdjcktqm2sb","sessionID":"ses_fd7355354ffe7kTYXjnT6SKuqc","type":"text","text":"All cases pass. The one \"FAIL\" was my incorrect test expectation: `diff(2.0.0-1, 1.0.0)` is correctly `'premajor'` (stepping into a prerelease), matching `diff(1.0.0, 2.0.0-1)`.\n\nThe fix in `functions/diff.js` correctly handles:\n- null for identical / build-only-differing versions (via `compare() === 0`)\n- ordinary `major`/`minor`/`patch` steps\n- `'pre'`-prefixed steps into a prerelease\n- `'prerelease'` for two prereleases of the same main version\n- stepping out of a prerelease classified by the prerelease's main (`major` when minor&patch are 0, `minor` when minor≠0 & patch=0, else `patch`)\n- order-independence (classifies by the uniquely-determined prerelease side)\n- `TypeError` on invalid input (via `parse(..., true)`)","time":{"start":1787390844495,"end":1787390846293}}}
